{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">流浮山雞伯嶺路一個貨倉下午1時15分發生火警。火勢猛烈，並冒出大量濃煙。消防處接報後列為三級火警。現場貨倉面積50米乘30米，消防出動四條喉及四隊煙帽隊灌救，並派出兩輛救護車戒備，暫時未有受傷報告。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"FIRE 20260917\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gnu6idflvr1789639759.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"FIRE 20260917\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>消防處：下午1時29分升三級　全力撲救</strong><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防處稱，下午1時15分接獲報告指流浮山鳳降村一個貨倉發生火警，並於下午1時29分將火警升為三級，現正進行滅火行動。及至下午4時，消防處再指，消防人員正全力撲救流浮山鳳降村貨倉發生的三級火警，保障附近市民安全。市民請盡量避免靠近火場，如身處室內並受到煙霧或異味影響，請立刻關閉門窗，保持室內通風系統適當運作。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"FIRE 20260917\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026OZjomCncRN1789639773.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"FIRE 20260917\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>下午3時火勢開始受控　約20多人疏散</strong><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場消息指至下午3時左右火勢開始受控。初步約有20多人須疏散到安全位置暫避。<br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"FIRE 20260917\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026tFCqcl6jHm1789639788.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"FIRE 20260917\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T10:39:03.318539+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}